From 844dd4fc388b8eb58a8c9e46722705af94b838a8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Abinash <abinash.haldorai@eka.care>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 15:04:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] WhatsApp: link-button carousel and a doctor carousel

Link carousel: when every card's primary CTA is a link with no tool to run, the
cards get a URL button each (Meta needs one button type on every card); otherwise
quick-reply buttons as before.

Doctor carousel: the doctor step of a doctor_card can go out as a carousel with
profile pictures, behind DOCTOR_CAROUSEL_ENABLED (default off), only when every
doctor has a picture. A tap selects the doctor exactly like a list tap. Dates
and slots stay lists.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017jupsGPaMwDF6ADjpb25ED
